{"ID":"20230926164314-s9khnuw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926164314-s9khnuw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926164314-s9khnuw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926164317-p5ovwr8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926164321-q8wfagw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926164321-q8wfagw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【桂枝当归汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926164321"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926164317-p5ovwr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926164317-p5ovwr8","updated":"20230926164317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：桂枝二两、当归三两、半夏一升、芍药三两、黄柏二两、甘草二两（炙）"}]},{"ID":"20230926164317-fqnruud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926164317-fqnruud","updated":"20230926164317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右七味，以水七升，煮取四升，去滓，分温三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926164317-ympxvrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926164317-ympxvrh","updated":"20230926164317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[3.23]传厥阴，脉沉弦而急，发热时悚，心烦呕逆，宜桂枝当归汤，吐蚘者，宜乌梅丸。"}]},{"ID":"20230926164321-q8wfagw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926164321-q8wfagw"}}]}